+## Original kart helmet redesign, 2026-10-25
+
+`game/vehicle/kart_helmet.gd` is original authored full-face competition helmet geometry. The current kart catalogue/newspaper images and 49 livery photos are native photographs of this unbranded model. No external model, manufacturer asset, texture, generated image or runtime service is added. The 22 new prepared helmet meshes replace 12 archived earlier helmet resources; all 196 remaining prepared mesh files are byte-identical. Current provenance, exact source hashes and owner/device acceptance limits: `docs/KART_HELMET_REDESIGN_2026_10_25.md` and `docs/evidence/kart-helmet-redesign-2026-10-25/report.json`. This supersedes the preceding refined kart's helmet and photographs; its historical provenance remains.
+<!-- /KART-HELMET-REDESIGN-20261025 -->
